WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.440
And of course women must earn less than man

00:00:02.940 --> 00:00:05.720
because they are weaker,

00:00:05.720 --> 00:00:07.720
they are smaller,

00:00:07.720 --> 00:00:10.460
they are less intelligent and they must earn less.

00:00:10.460 --> 00:00:11.160
That's all.

00:00:13.020 --> 00:00:15.020
García Pérez.

00:00:18.120 --> 00:00:19.220
Dear deputy,

00:00:19.220 --> 00:00:21.960
according to your opinion,

00:00:21.960 --> 00:00:23.980
I should not have the right to be here,

00:00:24.020 --> 00:00:25.080
as a Member of this Parliament.

00:00:25.080 --> 00:00:26.880
And I know that it hurts you.

00:00:26.880 --> 00:00:29.080
I know that it hurts you and bothers you that

00:00:29.080 --> 00:00:31.940
today women can sit in this House to represent

00:00:31.940 --> 00:00:34.760
the European citizens with the same rights as you.

00:00:34.880 --> 00:00:38.380
I am here to defend all European women

00:00:38.380 --> 00:00:40.380
from men like you.

